Agrius convolvuli mitochondrial genome assembly
================================================

Assigned Galaxy history: bbd44e69cb8906b56bba41f9a67fc80e
Input collection: af7ddb2558d449b3
Input HiFi read dataset: f9cad7b01a472135e224348fcd73dddd

Workflow:
1. Obtained close mitochondrial reference OP219771.1 (15510 bp) in the
   assigned history with MitoHiFi find_reference mode.
2. MitoHiFi de novo assembly could not run in this environment because the
   Galaxy job attempted Apptainer/proot and failed with an Operation not
   permitted ptrace error.
3. Used Galaxy-native tools as a fallback:
   - minimap2 mapped the HiFi reads to OP219771.1.
   - Mapped reads were extracted and remapped to the reference.
   - bcftools mpileup (with indel calling enabled at high depth) and
     bcftools call produced SNP and high-confidence INDEL calls.
   - A curated VCF of high-quality calls was applied with bcftools
     consensus to generate the final reference-guided assembly.

Key Galaxy datasets:
- Reference FASTA: f9cad7b01a47213514c7e8f98575c444
- Focused mapped BAM: f9cad7b01a47213566fb2495282f1e34
- High-depth mpileup VCF: f9cad7b01a472135bebe3bfb339b6682
- Curated VCF: f9cad7b01a47213549b91d96e4cfa297
- Final Galaxy consensus FASTA: f9cad7b01a4721356266315cf4287cad

